When a pair is first enqueued, its recorded prefix is shortest among prefixes reaching that pair; appending any permissible suffix depends on the pair, not the path taken to get there. At most the product of vertex and automaton-state counts is visited. This rewrite would not enumerate all equally short witnesses, and it intentionally accepts a zero-edge witness when source equals target and the automaton accepts the empty word.
